            "sourceContext": "physical/printed57 module9.1 P is compulsory exclusively Leistungsfach, Lewis donor/acceptor and coordinate bonding. Page58 module9.2 W is optional; theory comparison only if optional8.7 was taught. Page36 complexometry is deepening/linkage; page29 keeps the elective pool. No individual selection is asserted.",
